{"name": "Drift Scrappers", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4758570/extras/6e1ce5fbbc736145bd39a7a9a13120e7.poster.avif?t=1793815402\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4758570/extras/6e1ce5fbbc736145bd39a7a9a13120e7.webm?t=1793815402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4758570/extras/6e1ce5fbbc736145bd39a7a9a13120e7.mp4?t=1793815402\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drift Scrappers is a roguelite autobattler where you put together a crew of space scavengers and see what you can get away with. Choose your route through fights, rewards, and events, then let your scrappers loose in automatic battles. Find gear, try out builds, and go after the good stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4758570/extras_big/5494dfc54b024eb8cc795167cfb8ac30.webp?t=1793815402\" height=\"96\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4758570/extras/5494dfc54b024eb8cc795167cfb8ac30.avif?t=1793815402\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit up to five scrappers, each with their own role and abilities. Bring a healer or blast your way through with brute force. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4758570/extras/76a491cb8b0217db16d19e632fc7138f.poster.avif?t=1793815402\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4758570/extras/76a491cb8b0217db16d19e632fc7138f.webm?t=1793815402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4758570/extras/76a491cb8b0217db16d19e632fc7138f.mp4?t=1793815402\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4758570/extras_big/5813f060c6e484e36eff19972071a639.webp?t=1793815402\" height=\"96\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4758570/extras/5813f060c6e484e36eff19972071a639.avif?t=1793815402\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each scrapper has their own gear, while chips affect the whole crew. Maybe you want to set the world on fire. Maybe you just want to play it safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4758570/extras/d0e7c330c727e3dc603265b5986dd5f0.poster.avif?t=1793815402\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4758570/extras/d0e7c330c727e3dc603265b5986dd5f0.webm?t=1793815402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4758570/extras/d0e7c330c727e3dc603265b5986dd5f0.mp4?t=1793815402\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4758570/extras_big/db966256c57ec3ff709777de20d5e817.webp?t=1793815402\" height=\"96\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4758570/extras/db966256c57ec3ff709777de20d5e817.avif?t=1793815402\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a crew of up to five scrappers, each with their own role and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine each scrapper\u2019s gear with chips that affect the whole crew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose starting positions and use pads to give your crew an edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new scrappers, items, chips, and relics between runs, opening up more combinations to try.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on higher difficulties and see how far your builds can go in endless loops.</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Build a crew of space scavengers in this sci-fi roguelite autobattler. Recruit scrappers, gear them up, set your formation, and watch the tactical chaos play out!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4758570/6e95fccc95cdcc0aa266968beeeca22592bf6a00/header.jpg?t=1793815402", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Auto Battler", "Roguelike", "PvE", "Choices Matter", "Action Roguelike"], "developers": "Howltide", "publishers": "Howltide", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4758570", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "4 November 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/drkCmD0VVDY", "first_seen": 1793746800.0, "review_rank": 19}